  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektm&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att Lithuanian Standards Board skall besitta till- r&#xe4;ckliga kunskaper f&#xf6;r att kunna etablera och driva system och procedurer f&#xf6;r notifiering och informationsutbyte i enlighet med EUs direktiv 83/189 samt WTO/TBT avtalet. F&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntade resultat &#xe4;r bl a att en analys skall finnas framtagen, utbildning till LSTs personal.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is to provide the Lithuanian Standards Board andthe responsible authorities with information on the establishment and running of the notification and information procedures in the WTO/TBT Agreement and the 83/189 Directive a&quot;WTO Enquiry point&quot; and to supportthe relevant bodies in devel. the leg. framework and inst.structures.</narrative>
  </description>
